WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.632 --> 00:00:01.700
(dramatic instrumental music)

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:05.596
- [Narrator] March 1963,
the CIA is planning

00:00:05.596 --> 00:00:10.257
to kill Fidel Castro using
his greatest guilty pleasure:

00:00:10.257 --> 00:00:11.702
a milkshake.

00:00:11.702 --> 00:00:12.535
(slurping)

00:00:12.535 --> 00:00:13.452
- [Man] Mm.

00:00:15.133 --> 00:00:17.720
- [Narrator] The U.S. feared
Castro's anti-American views,

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:19.422
and according to Castro's bodyguard,

00:00:19.422 --> 00:00:23.261
the CIA plotted 638 times to sabotage him

00:00:23.261 --> 00:00:25.965
trying things like chemical
powder on his boots,

00:00:25.965 --> 00:00:28.876
a bacterial-lined scuba
suit, spiked cigars,

00:00:28.876 --> 00:00:30.626
and exploding cigars.

00:00:31.748 --> 00:00:34.697
But, the closest the CIA
came to killing Castro?

00:00:34.697 --> 00:00:36.673
Poisoning his chocolate milkshake

00:00:36.673 --> 00:00:39.543
at his favorite ice cream parlor.

00:00:39.543 --> 00:00:41.973
The dictator had an obsession with dairy,

00:00:41.973 --> 00:00:44.479
ice cream, milkshakes, you name it.

00:00:44.479 --> 00:00:47.432
I mean, it gets hot in Cuba.

00:00:47.432 --> 00:00:49.208
So, the CIA convinced mafia members

00:00:49.208 --> 00:00:50.710
to carry out the plot.

00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:52.696
The mobsters delivered
a pill containing poison

00:00:52.696 --> 00:00:54.512
to a waiter who would slipped the capsule

00:00:54.512 --> 00:00:56.662
into Castro's milkshake.

00:00:56.662 --> 00:00:58.276
The waiter placed the pill in the freezer

00:00:58.276 --> 00:01:00.174
until the time was right,

00:01:00.174 --> 00:01:02.433
but the pill froze to the freezer's lining

00:01:02.433 --> 00:01:04.411
and when he went to pick
it up, the pill ripped open

00:01:04.411 --> 00:01:06.469
spilling poison everywhere.

00:01:06.469 --> 00:01:09.511
So, the would-be assassin
waiter abandoned the plot.

00:01:09.511 --> 00:01:11.428
The mission was a bust.

00:01:12.732 --> 00:01:13.842
Castro went on to become one

00:01:13.842 --> 00:01:15.944
of the world's longest ruling leaders,

00:01:15.944 --> 00:01:19.055
arrogantly boasting, "If
surviving assassination attempts

00:01:19.055 --> 00:01:23.222
"were an Olympic event, I
would win the gold medal."

